                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The classic vertical scroller that first got me enthusiastic about fighters even before Ace Combat and Wing Commander is now back with modern system support! The year is 2026, I had thought that I completed all 10 Achievements for this title in 2015 re-release itself. But just a few days prior to this review, the developer released a big update that fixed a tonne of bugs and glitches and even a NEW 11TH ACHIEVEMENT! The game plays better than ever now! Simple, yet challenging and exciting. It looks just as beautiful, no even more so, than I remember it in childhood!\n\nP.S. You can even switch between the Music in the options menu to the Classic if you prefer the original version.",
